{
  "dom_id": "step-e12805",
  "name": "Example: Raising an Integer to a Negative Power",
  "problem": "Evaluate $2^{-3}.$",
  "worked_solution": "We find the reciprocal of the base $({\\color{blue}{2}}),$ and then raise that reciprocal to the same power but with the *opposite* sign $({{\\color{red}{+3}}}),$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{2}^{-3} & ={(\\frac{1}{2})}^{3} \\\\  & =(\\frac{1}{2})\\times (\\frac{1}{2})\\times (\\frac{1}{2}) \\\\  & =(\\frac{1\\times 1\\times 1}{2\\times 2\\times 2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{8}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e12805\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Raising an Integer to a Negative Power</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e12805\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                        